        "What is pr09re55? Well, it’s my tiny little jewel box. It’s a feeling, a mood and everything I’d love to introduce to the people who share the same values as I do. A place where I feel good, at home… a place where I’m happy to receive the precious few who are attracted to the warmth and unpretentious sophistication it exudes.",
        "Perfumes, skincare for ladies and gents, scented candles, home fragrances, accessories, niche jewelry, small interior design articles and furnitures, teas and much, much more. And, of course, a small selection of our specialty cocktails, long-drinks, bubbles and wines that you can enjoy on our terrace, in the store space or in our cozy hide-away corner upstairs.",
